{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Magic systems differ in their bookkeeping, not in their effects. An at-will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cantrip, a spell memorized from a book and spent in the speaking, a bolt paid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for out of an energy pool, and a scroll good for one reading all do the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sort of thing to the world; what separates them is when the game says no. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library keeps the two apart. A spell’s effect is an ordinary rule body, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly as any other rule body is, and a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost"},{"type":"text","text":" sits beside it deciding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"availability and price."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A spell’s identity is its own intent, declared with "},{"code":"#verb","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" like any custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verb, so "},{"code":"glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"cast glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"read passwall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are parser rows and a spell can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry as many phrasings as its author wants. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:cost:effect:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns the actions that intent needs — the cast handler, plus the memorize"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler when the cost is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"splices them into its "},{"code":"actions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a "},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", because it has state to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"save. The finite spell memory and the energy pool are "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s it owns, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both travel in a save and come back correctly under UNDO; the defaults are 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slots and 12 mana. Everything else is the host’s: the spellbook, the scroll, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"targets, and every word of prose an effect prints. The bundle contributes one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verb of its own — "},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"code":"magic","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), which reports what is held in mind and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how much energy is left — promotes the engine’s "},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" stub to refilling the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pool (and teaches it "},{"code":"meditate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and adds "},{"code":"spell","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the parser’s noise words,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so "},{"code":"cast the glow spell","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reaches "},{"code":"glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Its own lines are a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text"},{"type":"text","text":", passed at init."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Casting runs gate, effect, pay. Availability is checked first; the effect runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second and may refuse on its own account with "},{"code":"require","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"reply","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; only an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effect that finished pays. So a firebolt aimed at nothing costs no energy, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scroll read at the wrong wall survives."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Wiring it in","anchor":"Wiring-it-in"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoSpellcasting","","extension Intent {","    #verb(\"glow\", [\"glow\"], [\"cast\", \"glow\"])","    #verb(","        \"firebolt\", [\"firebolt\"], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\"],","        [\"firebolt\", .directObject], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\", \"at\", .directObject])","}","","struct Tower: Game {","    let magic = Spellcasting(memorySlots: 3, maxMana: 12)","","    var content: GameContents { magic }","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { [.glow, .firebolt] }","","    var actions: [IntentAction] {","        magic.spell(.glow, cost: .cantrip) {","            say(\"Pale light seeps from your fingers.\")","        }","        magic.spell(.firebolt, cost: .energy(4)) {","            guard let target = command.directObject else {","                try reply(\"Cast firebolt at what?\")","            }","            target.vanish()","            say(\"Fire leaps from your hand and bursts against \\(target.definiteName).\")","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)"},{"type":"text","text":" spell carries its own memorize intent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the one "},{"code":"spell(_:cost:effect:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call registers both halves:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["magic.spell(.unbar, cost: .prepared(book: spellbook, learnVia: .learnUnbar)) {","    try require(!wardedDoor.isOpen, else: \"The door already stands open.\")","    wardedDoor.isOpen = true","    say(\"The warding-marks gutter and die, and the door drifts open.\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"code":"book: nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the spell can be memorized anywhere; pass an item and it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be in hand."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"The worked example","anchor":"The-worked-example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Gramarye\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a small original game built to test the claim in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first sentence of this page. It runs one spell per paradigm and chains them so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each opens exactly one obstacle: the cantrip finds the scroll, the memorized"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spell opens the warded door, the energy spell destroys the golem, the scroll"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passes the wall. Remove any one of the four and the amulet is unreachable, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is a stronger demonstration than four spells that happen to work. Its design"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document is "},{"code":"docs\/games\/gramarye.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/init(memorySlots:maxMana:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/memorySlots","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/maxMana"],"anchor":"The-bundle","title":"The bundle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/SpellList","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Energy"],"anchor":"The-systems-voice","title":"The system’s voice"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:cost:effect:)"],"anchor":"Registering-a-spell","title":"Registering a spell"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/cantrip","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/scroll(_:)"],"anchor":"The-four-paradigms","title":"The four paradigms"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords"],"anchor":"What-the-bundle-contributes-to-the-host","title":"What the bundle contributes to the host"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Gnusto"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","generated":true}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoSpellcasting"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"GnustoSpellcasting","externalID":"GnustoSpellcasting"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Four ways a spell becomes available, over one way of writing what it does."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/scroll(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/scroll(_:)","title":"SpellCost.scroll(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/scroll(_:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scroll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Read from the given scroll item, which is consumed when the spell is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cast. Refused unless the scroll is in hand.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/energy(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/energy(_:)","title":"SpellCost.energy(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"energy"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Draws the given amount from the shared magical-energy pool; refused when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pool is too low. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rest"},{"type":"text","text":" restores the pool to full."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/noiseWords":{"title":"noiseWords","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/noisewords","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noiseWords"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"text":"“spell” is filler in a casting game — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast the glow spell"},{"text":" should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parse as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast glow"},{"text":" — so the layer adds it to the parser’s noise set.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/verbs":{"title":"verbs","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/verbs","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/verbs","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verbs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SyntaxRule","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The verbs the spellcasting layer contributes: ","type":"text"},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"magic","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports the caster’s state, and "},{"code":"meditate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as a second word for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engine’s own "},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions"},{"type":"text","text":" promotes to refilling the pool."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/spell(_:cost:effect:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/spell(_:cost:effect:)","title":"spell(_:cost:effect:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:cost:effect:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spell"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Intent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cost"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SpellCost","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoSpellcasting9SpellCostO"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"effect"},{"kind":"text","text":": () "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"IntentAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto12IntentActionV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers one spell: the stage-4 behavior that casting its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"intent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"performs, and — for a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" spell — the behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of memorizing it via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"prepareIntent"},{"type":"text","text":". Splice the result into the game’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/maxMana":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/maxmana","title":"maxMana","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/maxMana","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxMana"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The full magical-energy pool "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rest"},{"type":"text","text":" restores to."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost","title":"SpellCost","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpellCost"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpellCost","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How a spell becomes available to cast, and what casting it costs — the axis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that lets one spellcasting system express the common RPG magic paradigms"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without changing how a spell’s "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"effect"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is written."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/Text/energy":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/text\/energy","title":"energy","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text\/energy","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"energy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","text":"Line"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoSpellcasting0B0V","text":"Spellcasting"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoSpellcasting0B0V6EnergyV","text":"Energy"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spells"},{"text":" report’s energy line.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Gnusto":{"title":"Gnusto","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/gnusto","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Gnusto","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/Text/spellsHeld":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/text\/spellsheld","title":"spellsHeld","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text\/spellsHeld","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spellsHeld"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6G